==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Firecracker]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A super easy stage, just bring the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] for an easy win.

